      "text": "P0 Receipts and verifier\n\nRuntime, sandbox, metering,\nhash chain, Merkle, signing.\nReceipt spec with test vectors.\nVerifier library and CLI.\nUnattested: dev key, marked.\n\nRuns on: A laptop or one host\n\nMeasure:\nCost of a receipt, evidence\nsize, cost of an audit",
