      "width": 1576.96,
      "height": 80.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1759390061,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 924538201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 P0 can run on modest hardware and P1 cannot: anything involving attestation needs supported hardware, so that cost starts at P1 and should be priced from a spike, not assumed\n2 P0 builds around the receipt-format specification and the verifier first. They keep the format honest and make independent audit achievable\n3 Production is decided at P3, not before. The measurement from CI must equal the measurement that is published\n4 The orchestration track is a proposal (HLD section 9). O-numbers avoid M0 to M4, which name the simulation's mechanisms. The router asks the requester until P4",
      "originalText": "1 P0 can run on modest hardware and P1 cannot: anything involving attestation needs supported hardware, so that cost starts at P1 and should be priced from a spike, not assumed\n2 P0 builds around the receipt-format specification and the verifier first. They keep the format honest and make independent audit achievable\n3 Production is decided at P3, not before. The measurement from CI must equal the measurement that is published\n4 The orchestration track is a proposal (HLD section 9). O-numbers avoid M0 to M4, which name the simulation's mechanisms. The router asks the requester until P4",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te59",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1399.0,
      "width": 1587.6000000000001,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1855392517,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1181587504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase boxes show what exists afterwards, not a schedule: no dates are committed here \u00b7 Tags: OPEN = undecided (HLD section 11), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
      "originalText": "Phase boxes show what exists afterwards, not a schedule: no dates are committed here \u00b7 Tags: OPEN = undecided (HLD section 11), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
